{"html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Claude — sampled reference reconstruction</title>\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;width:100%;height:100%;overflow:hidden;background:#1B1C13}#root{position:relative;width:100%;height:100%;overflow:hidden}canvas{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain}\n</style>\n<script src=\"gsap.min.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div id=\"root\" data-composition-id=\"main\" data-width=\"1280\" data-height=\"720\" data-duration=\"10\" data-fps=\"60\">\n<canvas id=\"art\" class=\"clip\" data-start=\"0\" data-duration=\"10\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Hi. I read every word. I think it through. I tell it straight. I build with you. I’m Claude. Opus 5.5.\"></canvas>\n</div>\n<!--\nEDITABLE RECONSTRUCTION BRIEF AND PROVENANCE\nCreator: @souravbhar871\nSource: https://x.com/souravbhar871/status/2103711849703477361\nAdapted experiment target: gpt-6.1-sol / high. Actual execution metadata belongs\nin the recording harness; this source does not attest to a particular CLI run.\n1280×720, 10.0 seconds, intended capture at 60 fps, silent.\n\n0.00–1.0167: Original partial-stroke greeting entrance retained.\n1.0167–1.1667: Greeting enlarges, becomes extremely cropped, then the orange\nperiod expands into a full orange field. Camera interpolation is inferred;\nrequired sampled states are encoded explicitly at 1.05, 1.0667 and 1.15.\n1.1667–2.66: Collage enters first; no foreground title at 1.2667. The heavy\nreading statement subsequently reveals and is fully present at 2.0.\n2.66–3.34: Near-black field with the small orange dot.\n3.34–4.64: Preserved thought-path geometry and text choreography.\n4.64–6.60: Refined individual letter weights, rotations and g/h overlap;\nretained alignment motion and foreground ivory rule.\n6.60–7.78: Retained collaboration card and hard offset extrusion.\n7.78–10.00: Retained identity reveal and newly drawn radial emblem. Opu remains\nvisible at 9.0; subtitle completes to exactly Opus 5.5 by 9.85. This supersedes\nthe older reconstruction instruction forbidding subtitle completion.\n\nAll unsupplied intermediate trajectories and timing remain inferred. Straight-on\nview throughout; the short greeting enlargement acts on the flat artwork.\n\nDEPENDENCY AND ASSET LEDGER\n- gsap.min.js: supplied locally by the harness; sole runtime dependency.\n- Canvas lettering contours, diagram, emblem and scene assembly: newly authored.\n- Generic system typography: shared approximation, not recovered source fonts.\n- Supplied Bangers.ttf and Caveat.ttf: unused.\n- Collage text: newly authored illustrative text; no exact transcription claimed.\n- Reference images: visual guidance only; never loaded or drawn.\n- No audio, external images, remote fonts, modules or network requests.\n\nREVIEW STATUS\nSource only. No render, poster, execution log, technical validation, matched-time\nreview or fidelity score is claimed. Exact source typography, unreadable collage\nfragments and unsampled transition details remain unresolved.\n-->\n<script>\n(function(){\n'use strict';\nconst canvas=document.getElementById('art');\nconst ctx=canvas.getContext('2d');\nconst W=1280,H=720,DURATION=10;\nconst C={ivory:'#F1EFDF',ink:'#1B1C13',orange:'#C35D3D'};\nconst clamp=v=>Math.max(0,Math.min(1,v));\nconst lerp=(a,b,p)=>a+(b-a)*p;\nfunction smooth(a,b,t){const p=clamp((t-a)/(b-a));return p*p*(3-2*p);}\nfunction out(a,b,t){const p=clamp((t-a)/(b-a));return 1-Math.pow(1-p,3);}\nfunction background(color){ctx.fillStyle=color;ctx.fillRect(0,0,W,H);}\nfunction disc(x,y,r,color){ctx.beginPath();ctx.arc(x,y,Math.max(0,r),0,Math.PI*2);ctx.fillStyle=color;ctx.fill();}\nfunction roundedRect(x,y,w,h,r,color){ctx.beginPath();ctx.roundRect(x,y,w,h,r);ctx.fillStyle=color;ctx.fill();}\nfunction textFit(text,x,y,width,size,family='sans-serif',weight=900,color=C.ink,stroke=0){\n ctx.save();ctx.font=weight+' '+size+'px '+family;ctx.textAlign='left';ctx.textBaseline='alphabetic';\n const measured=ctx.measureText(text).width;\n ctx.translate(x,y);ctx.scale(width/measured,1);ctx.fillStyle=color;\n if(stroke){ctx.lineJoin='round';ctx.strokeStyle=color;ctx.lineWidth=stroke;ctx.strokeText(text,0,0);}\n ctx.fillText(text,0,0);ctx.restore();\n}\nfunction pathStroke(d,color,width,reveal=1,length=2000){\n ctx.save();ctx.strokeStyle=color;ctx.lineWidth=width;ctx.lineCap='round';ctx.lineJoin='round';\n if(reveal<1){ctx.setLineDash([length,length]);ctx.lineDashOffset=length*(1-clamp(reveal));}\n ctx.stroke(new Path2D(d));ctx.restore();\n}\n\nconst hiH=new Path2D('M320 203 C356 196 399 197 420 215 Q438 231 438 260 L438 341 Q478 338 504 357 L504 204 C539 197 580 199 601 216 Q618 231 618 260 L618 489 Q618 527 624 556 C591 566 550 566 530 553 Q504 538 504 497 L504 446 L438 446 L438 556 Q390 568 352 552 Q326 543 326 499 L326 435 Q309 424 310 385 L310 341 L326 341 L326 245 Z');\nconst hiI=new Path2D('M650 278 C690 272 749 272 774 291 Q789 302 788 330 L788 486 Q788 526 796 558 C764 565 723 565 701 556 Q677 546 677 517 L677 383 Q657 404 651 380 Q643 352 644 307 Q643 287 650 278 Z');\nconst greetingKeys=[\n {t:1.0166667,s:1,x:640,y:360},\n {t:1.05,s:2.5,x:640,y:360},\n {t:1.0666667,s:8,x:650,y:390},\n {t:1.1166667,s:10,x:884,y:507},\n {t:1.15,s:13,x:872,y:500},\n {t:1.1666667,s:22,x:884,y:507}\n];\nfunction greetingCamera(t){\n if(t<=greetingKeys[0].t)return greetingKeys[0];\n for(let i=1;i<greetingKeys.length;i++){\n  const a=greetingKeys[i-1],b=greetingKeys[i];\n  if(t<=b.t){const p=smooth(a.t,b.t,t);return {s:lerp(a.s,b.s,p),x:lerp(a.x,b.x,p),y:lerp(a.y,b.y,p)};}\n }\n return greetingKeys[greetingKeys.length-1];\n}\nfunction greeting(t){\n background(C.ivory);\n const camera=greetingCamera(t);\n ctx.save();ctx.translate(640,360);ctx.scale(camera.s,camera.s);ctx.translate(-camera.x,-camera.y);\n const stem=1-smooth(.07,.26,t),rise=out(.045,.88,t);\n if(stem>0){ctx.save();ctx.globalAlpha=stem;roundedRect(420,620-130*rise,34,210,17,C.ink);roundedRect(550,620-110*rise,36,210,18,C.ink);ctx.restore();}\n ctx.save();ctx.globalAlpha=smooth(.06,.25,t);ctx.translate(640,420*(1-rise));ctx.scale(lerp(.79,1,rise),1);ctx.translate(-640,0);\n ctx.fillStyle=C.ink;ctx.fill(hiH);\n ctx.save();const ip=out(.17,.82,t);ctx.translate(0,120*(1-ip));ctx.globalAlpha*=ip;ctx.fill(hiI);disc(723,207,42,C.ink);ctx.restore();\n const dp=out(.37,.91,t);disc(884,507,51*dp,C.orange);ctx.restore();ctx.restore();\n}\n\n// Original prose and notation provide density without claiming transcription.\nconst fragments=[\n 'Dear Mira, I kept your question beside the window. Let us begin with what we know.',\n 'hello · bonjour · hola · ciao · olá · hallo · namaste · merhaba · salve · hej · aloha',\n 'const next = ideas.map(refine); // a small change can open another door',\n 'Add the flour a little at a time. Fold gently, then leave room for the dough to rise.',\n 'SELECT possibility FROM questions WHERE curiosity > 0; read(); consider(); revise();',\n 'n = 1024 · mean = 0.62 · interval [0.41, 0.83] · change +12% · x² + y² = r²',\n 'A sentence carries its context. A quiet detail can change the whole explanation.',\n 'import { patience } from practice; while (learning) { ask(); build(); test(); }',\n 'Measure carefully. Read the question once more. Follow the thread to its end.',\n 'Comment ça va? · Come stai? · Tudo bem? · Hoe gaat het? · How is your day?',\n 'The first draft is a beginning. Keep the useful parts; make the next version clearer.',\n 'if (uncertain) { compare(evidence); } else { explain(reasoning); }'\n];\nconst rowSizes=[13,11,26,15,12,35,14,19,11,29,15,12,24,14,11,32,18,12,25,13,30,14,11,23,15,12];\nfunction heavyReadingLine(text,x,y,width,size,offset){\n ctx.save();ctx.font='900 '+size+'px sans-serif';ctx.textBaseline='alphabetic';ctx.textAlign='left';\n const chars=Array.from(text),advances=chars.map(ch=>ctx.measureText(ch).width);\n const full=advances.reduce((a,b)=>a+b,0)-Math.max(0,chars.length-1)*3;\n ctx.translate(x,y);ctx.scale(width/full,1);\n let cursor=0;\n const shifts=[0,-2,2,-1,3,-2,1,0,-2,2,1];\n const tilts=[-.009,.006,-.012,.008,-.005,.011,-.006,0,.009];\n chars.forEach((ch,i)=>{\n  if(ch!==' '){\n   ctx.save();ctx.translate(cursor,shifts[(i+offset)%shifts.length]);ctx.rotate(tilts[(i+offset)%tilts.length]);\n   ctx.scale(1,[1.02,.98,1.035,1,.99][(i+offset)%5]);\n   ctx.fillStyle=C.ivory;ctx.strokeStyle=C.ivory;ctx.lineJoin='round';ctx.lineWidth=10+(i%3)*1.5;\n   ctx.strokeText(ch,0,0);ctx.fillText(ch,0,0);ctx.restore();\n  }\n  cursor+=advances[i]-3;\n });ctx.restore();\n}\nfunction reading(t){\n background(C.orange);\n const collage=out(1.18,1.25,t);\n ctx.save();ctx.beginPath();ctx.rect(0,0,W,H);ctx.clip();\n let y=-8;\n for(let row=0;row<rowSizes.length;row++){\n  const size=rowSizes[row];y+=size+9+(row%3)*2;\n  ctx.font=(row%4===2?'800 ':row%3===0?'600 ':'400 ')+size+'px monospace';ctx.textBaseline='alphabetic';\n  const pale=row%6===1||row===15;\n  ctx.fillStyle=pale?C.ivory:C.ink;ctx.globalAlpha=collage*(pale?.82:row%4===0?.67:.94);\n  const text=fragments[row%fragments.length]+' · '+fragments[(row+5)%fragments.length];\n  const x=-34-(row%4)*23+12*Math.sin((t-2)*1.2+row*.8);\n  ctx.fillText(text,x,y);\n }\n ctx.restore();\n const p=out(1.43,1.87,t);\n if(p>0){ctx.save();ctx.translate(0,35*(1-p));ctx.globalAlpha=p;\n heavyReadingLine('I read',94,327,582,158,0);\n heavyReadingLine('every word',94,495,905,158,4);\n disc(1042,475,20,C.ink);ctx.restore();}\n}\nfunction lonelyDot(){background(C.ink);disc(973,131,14,C.orange);}\n\nconst thought={\n top:'M77 280 C133 375 209 304 335 380',\n bottom:'M98 505 C119 411 215 383 335 380',\n upper:'M335 380 C437 368 527 427 639 390 C705 367 696 307 658 305 C600 302 600 401 681 391 C740 384 735 362 791 356 C936 350 967 253 974 120',\n lower:'M335 380 C258 380 272 482 313 590 C339 675 496 657 700 654 C887 650 1080 656 1153 627 C1182 616 1182 596 1169 577'\n};\nfunction thinking(t){\n background(C.ink);\n const p=smooth(3.34,3.78,t),line=out(3.42,3.98,t);\n pathStroke(thought.top,C.ivory,3,line,340);\n pathStroke(thought.bottom,C.ivory,3,line,340);\n pathStroke(thought.upper,C.orange,5,line,1000);\n pathStroke(thought.lower,C.orange,5,out(3.48,4.01,t),1250);\n if(line>.05){disc(77,280,7*line,C.ivory);disc(98,505,7*line,C.ivory);}\n disc(lerp(973,335,p),lerp(131,380,p),lerp(14,9,p),C.orange);\n ctx.save();const first=out(3.43,3.86,t);ctx.globalAlpha=first;ctx.translate(0,17*(1-first));\n textFit('I think',95,207,535,108,'monospace',900,C.ivory,1);ctx.restore();\n ctx.save();const second=out(3.56,3.99,t);ctx.globalAlpha=second;ctx.translate(0,23*(1-second));\n textFit('it through',385,590,757,108,'monospace',900,C.ivory,1);disc(1169,577,15,C.orange);ctx.restore();\n}\n\nconst letters=Array.from('straight');\nconst scattered=[\n {x:169,y:491,size:226,r:-.12,f:'sans-serif',w:400,italic:false},\n {x:274,y:487,size:246,r:-.29,f:'sans-serif',w:900,italic:false},\n {x:407,y:516,size:219,r:.24,f:'serif',w:400,italic:true},\n {x:512,y:521,size:242,r:-.19,f:'serif',w:400,italic:true},\n {x:650,y:478,size:188,r:.19,f:'sans-serif',w:800,italic:true},\n {x:724,y:429,size:238,r:-.34,f:'sans-serif',w:900,italic:false},\n {x:803,y:410,size:249,r:-.09,f:'sans-serif',w:900,italic:false},\n {x:942,y:251,size:225,r:.72,f:'sans-serif',w:900,italic:false}\n];\nctx.font='900 220px sans-serif';\nconst widths=letters.map(ch=>ctx.measureText(ch).width);\nconst naturalWidth=widths.reduce((a,b)=>a+b,0),alignedScale=900/naturalWidth;\nconst targets=[];let cursor=174;\nwidths.forEach(w=>{targets.push(cursor);cursor+=w*alignedScale;});\nfunction glyph(ch,x,y,size,rotation,family,weight,scaleX,alpha,italic=false){\n if(alpha<=0)return;\n ctx.save();ctx.translate(x,y);ctx.rotate(rotation);ctx.scale(scaleX,1);ctx.globalAlpha=alpha;\n ctx.font=(italic?'italic ':'')+weight+' '+size+'px '+family;ctx.fillStyle=C.ink;ctx.textBaseline='alphabetic';ctx.textAlign='left';\n if(weight>=900){ctx.strokeStyle=C.ink;ctx.lineJoin='round';ctx.lineWidth=2;ctx.strokeText(ch,0,0);}\n ctx.fillText(ch,0,0);ctx.restore();\n}\nfunction straight(t){\n background(C.orange);\n const intro=out(4.64,4.94,t);\n ctx.save();ctx.globalAlpha=intro;textFit('I tell it',180,270,375,94,'monospace',400,C.ink);ctx.restore();\n const p=smooth(5.22,5.91,t),m=smooth(5.47,5.88,t);\n letters.forEach((ch,i)=>{\n  const s=scattered[i],x=lerp(s.x,targets[i],p),y=lerp(s.y,492,p)+35*(1-intro);\n  const size=lerp(s.size,220,p),rotation=s.r*(1-p),sx=lerp(1,alignedScale,p);\n  glyph(ch,x,y,size,rotation,s.f,s.w,sx,(1-m)*intro,s.italic);\n  glyph(ch,x,y,size,rotation,'sans-serif',900,sx,m*intro);\n });\n const rule=out(5.72,5.99,t);ctx.fillStyle=C.ivory;ctx.fillRect(0,442,1280*rule,6);\n}\n\nfunction collaboration(t){\n background(C.ivory);\n const p=out(6.60,6.94,t),depth=lerp(0,46,p);\n ctx.save();ctx.translate(0,36*(1-p));ctx.globalAlpha=p;\n for(let i=32;i>=1;i--){\n  const d=i/32*depth,shade=i>24?'#9E3F2D':i>13?'#B34B32':C.orange;\n  textFit('I build',175+d*.82,315+d,580,160,'sans-serif',900,shade,4);\n  textFit('with you.',365+d*.82,516+d,758,160,'sans-serif',900,shade,4);\n }\n textFit('I build',175,315,580,160,'sans-serif',900,C.ink,4);\n textFit('with you.',365,516,758,160,'sans-serif',900,C.ink,4);\n ctx.restore();\n}\n\n// Fresh asymmetric geometry approximates the observed radial emblem.\nconst spokes=[\n [-1.58,74],[-1.13,52],[-.75,60],[-.37,49],[-.08,70],\n [.36,73],[.77,68],[1.16,76],[1.66,58],[2.07,74],\n [2.53,57],[3.04,61],[3.55,75],[4.02,72]\n];\nfunction emblem(p){\n ctx.save();ctx.translate(1033,300);ctx.rotate(-.18*(1-p));ctx.scale(p,p);\n ctx.strokeStyle=C.orange;ctx.lineCap='round';ctx.lineWidth=14;\n spokes.forEach(s=>{const a=s[0],r=s[1];ctx.beginPath();ctx.moveTo(-Math.cos(a)*8,-Math.sin(a)*8);ctx.lineTo(Math.cos(a)*r,Math.sin(a)*r);ctx.stroke();});\n disc(0,0,16,C.orange);ctx.restore();\n}\nconst subtitle=[\n {ch:'O',index:0,y:461,start:8.79,end:8.86,alpha:1},\n {ch:'p',index:1,y:477,start:8.86,end:8.94,alpha:.87},\n {ch:'u',index:2,y:477,start:8.94,end:9.00,alpha:.62},\n {ch:'s',index:3,y:461,start:9.24,end:9.36,alpha:1},\n {ch:'5',index:5,y:461,start:9.46,end:9.60,alpha:1},\n {ch:'.',index:6,y:461,start:9.60,end:9.70,alpha:1},\n {ch:'5',index:7,y:461,start:9.70,end:9.84,alpha:1}\n];\nfunction identity(t){\n background(C.ink);\n const p=smooth(7.82,8.42,t);\n ctx.save();ctx.beginPath();ctx.rect(0,0,W,367);ctx.clip();\n textFit('I’m',lerp(160,180,p),lerp(450,361,p),230,151,'monospace',400,C.ivory);ctx.restore();\n const name=out(8.32,8.80,t);\n ctx.save();ctx.beginPath();ctx.rect(449,175,500*name,200);ctx.clip();\n textFit('Claude',455+22*(1-name),361,483,151,'sans-serif',900,C.ivory,3);ctx.restore();\n const star=out(8.57,8.96,t);if(star>0)emblem(star);\n const settle=smooth(9.08,9.45,t);\n ctx.save();ctx.font='400 62px monospace';ctx.textBaseline='alphabetic';ctx.textAlign='left';ctx.fillStyle=C.orange;\n subtitle.forEach(letter=>{\n  const q=out(letter.start,letter.end,t);if(q<=0)return;\n  const x=465+letter.index*37.3;\n  const baseline=lerp(letter.y,461,settle);\n  ctx.save();ctx.globalAlpha=q*lerp(letter.alpha,1,settle);\n  ctx.beginPath();ctx.rect(x-2,401,44,92);ctx.clip();\n  ctx.fillText(letter.ch,x,baseline+13*(1-q));ctx.restore();\n });ctx.restore();\n}\n\n// Stateless drawing: all geometry and lettering are computed from absolute time.\nfunction draw(time){\n const t=Math.max(0,Math.min(DURATION,time));\n ctx.setTransform(1,0,0,1,0,0);ctx.globalAlpha=1;ctx.globalCompositeOperation='source-over';\n ctx.setLineDash([]);ctx.lineDashOffset=0;ctx.lineWidth=1;ctx.lineCap='butt';ctx.lineJoin='miter';\n ctx.shadowBlur=0;ctx.shadowOffsetX=0;ctx.shadowOffsetY=0;ctx.filter='none';ctx.clearRect(0,0,W,H);\n if(t<1.1666667)greeting(t);\n else if(t<2.66)reading(t);\n else if(t<3.34)lonelyDot();\n else if(t<4.64)thinking(t);\n else if(t<6.60)straight(t);\n else if(t<7.78)collaboration(t);\n else identity(t);\n}\nconst playhead={t:0};\ndraw(0);\nconst timeline=gsap.timeline({paused:true});\ntimeline.to(playhead,{t:DURATION,duration:DURATION,ease:'none',onUpdate:function(){draw(playhead.t);}},0);\nwindow.__timelines=window.__timelines||{};\nwindow.__timelines['main']=timeline;\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>","width":1280,"height":720,"duration_seconds":10,"assumptions":["Unsampled motion and transition interpolation are inferred from the supplied sampled states.","Generic system lettering approximates the reference; collage text is newly authored.","The updated evidence supersedes the obsolete subtitle restriction: Opu at 9.0 seconds completes to Opus 5.5 by 9.85 seconds.","The composition is silent, matching the supplied zero-audio-stream metadata. Source has not been rendered or visually validated."],"missing_inputs":[],"summary":"Repaired greeting enlargement and orange-fill transition, delayed the collage title, refined lettering and scattered glyphs, and completed the closing subtitle while retaining diagram and collaboration motion."}